From: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
Subject: [PATCH] configs: isvp_t41nq_sfcnor: trim the image below 256 KiB

The SPL + LZMA U-Boot image is 263863 bytes, 1719 bytes over the 256 KiB
slot. Remove what the Thingino boot environment does not use: help and
line-editing text, xtrace, splash banner, verbose MMC, GPT/UUID support,
and the sound, pinmux, NFS, fdt and part commands. GZIP goes too; the
kernel image is LZMA.

FAT/MMC, USB, network/TFTP, sf, env and button support stay because the
autoupdate and loaduenv scripts use them.

Signed-off-by: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
---
--- a/configs/isvp_t41nq_sfcnor_defconfig
+++ b/configs/isvp_t41nq_sfcnor_defconfig
@@ -52,16 +52,16 @@
 # CONFIG_CMD_RANDOM is not set
 CONFIG_CMD_GPIO=y
 CONFIG_CMD_MMC=y
-CONFIG_CMD_PART=y
+# CONFIG_CMD_PART is not set
 CONFIG_CMD_USB=y
 CONFIG_CMD_DHCP=y
-CONFIG_CMD_NFS=y
+# CONFIG_CMD_NFS is not set
 CONFIG_CMD_PING=y
-CONFIG_CMD_SOUND=y
+# CONFIG_CMD_SOUND is not set
 CONFIG_CMD_FAT=y
 # CONFIG_CMD_CYCLIC is not set
 # CONFIG_SPL_DOS_PARTITION is not set
-CONFIG_EFI_PARTITION=y
+# CONFIG_EFI_PARTITION is not set
 # CONFIG_SPL_EFI_PARTITION is not set
 CONFIG_SPL_OF_CONTROL=y
 CONFIG_OF_SPL_REMOVE_PROPS="pinctrl-names interrupt-parent interrupts"
@@ -124,3 +124,14 @@
 # CONFIG_BINMAN_FDT is not set
 CONFIG_LZMA=y
 CONFIG_SPL_LZMA=y
+# Keep the SPL+LZMA image under 256 KiB; none of these are used by the
+# Thingino boot environment. FAT/MMC, USB, network/TFTP, sf and button stay.
+# CONFIG_SYS_LONGHELP is not set
+# CONFIG_CMDLINE_EDITING is not set
+# CONFIG_SYS_XTRACE is not set
+# CONFIG_SPL_BANNER_PRINT is not set
+# CONFIG_MMC_VERBOSE is not set
+# CONFIG_PARTITION_UUIDS is not set
+# CONFIG_CMD_PINMUX is not set
+# CONFIG_CMD_FDT is not set
+# CONFIG_GZIP is not set
